sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Flight API / email
    participant I as Adapter / event queue
    participant O as Trip Orchestrator
    participant P as Plan B rules
    participant N as Notification service
    participant U as User
    participant B as Booking provider
    A->>I: status delayed/cancelled + event_id + observed_at
    I->>I: validate, deduplicate, check freshness
    alt valid and fresh event
        I->>O: normalized status event
        O->>O: impact on connection, transfer, hotel, group
        O->>P: request feasible alternatives
        P-->>O: allowed + rejected options (with reasons)
        O->>N: create notification, idempotency key
        alt user offline
            N->>N: queue notification for later sync
        else user online
            N-->>U: push/in-app notification
        end
        U->>O: explicit approval of one option
        O->>B: request booking change (future system only)
        B-->>O: confirmed or failed
        O-->>U: update shared itinerary only after confirmation
    else duplicate or stale
        I-->>A: ignored; don't overwrite current state
    end
